sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React UI
  participant Controller as BookingController
  participant Service as BookingService
  participant ResourceRepo as ResourceRepository
  participant BookingRepo as BookingRepository
  User->>UI: Select resource, time and purpose
  UI->>Controller: POST /api/bookings (JWT)
  Controller->>Service: create(userId, request)
  Service->>ResourceRepo: find resource
  ResourceRepo-->>Service: resource and capacity/status
  Service->>BookingRepo: transaction: lock resource and check overlap
  BookingRepo-->>Service: no conflict, insert PENDING
  Service-->>Controller: booking
  Controller-->>UI: 201 PENDING
  UI-->>User: Show booking confirmation
